card.statement:
Let $\mathcal{H} $ and $\mathcal{H}'$ be crossed homomorphisms from $L$ to $ \mathfrak{L}\otimes A$.
If

\begin{equation*}
\begin{tikzpicture}[anchorbase]
\draw[bmod] (0.25, 0) -- (0.25,.25) -- (0, .5)--(0.25,.75)--(.25,1);
\draw[bmod] (0.25, 0.25) -- (.75,.75)--(0.75,1);
\draw[bmod] (.75, 0) -- (.75, .25)--(.25,.75);
\draw[bmod] (1, 0) -- (1, .5)--(.75,.75);
\btoken{0.75, .75}{west}{\rho};
\btoken{.25, .75}{east}{\psi};
\btoken{.25, .25}{east}{\mathcal{H}};
\end{tikzpicture} \ = \
\begin{tikzpicture}[anchorbase]
\draw[bmod] (0.25, 0) -- (0.25,.25) -- (0, .5)--(0.25,.75)--(.25,1);
\draw[bmod] (0.25, 0.25) -- (.75,.75)--(0.75,1);
\draw[bmod] (.75, 0) -- (.75, .25)--(.25,.75);
\draw[bmod] (1, 0) -- (1, .5)--(.75,.75);
\btoken{0.75, .75}{west}{\rho};
\btoken{.25, .75}{east}{\psi};
\btoken{.25, .25}{east}{\mathcal{H}'};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{equation*}

for all $(V,\psi)\in $ $\mathrm{ \bf Mod}_{\calC}(\mathfrak{L})$ and $(M;\rho, \gamma) \in$ ${\bf WMod}^{\calC}_A{\big(L\big)}$, then we have $\mathcal{F}_{\mathcal{H}}= \mathcal{F}_{\mathcal{H}'}$.
